msgid "Create a new account"
msgstr "Crear una cuenta nueva"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/complete.html:10
msgid "Password was reset"
msgstr "Contraseña restablecida"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/complete.html:14
msgid "Your password has been set.  You may go ahead and log in now."
msgstr "Tu contraseña se ha establecido. Ya puedes iniciar sesión."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/confirm.html:10
msgid "Reset your password"
msgstr "Restablecer tu contraseña"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/confirm.html:15
msgid ""
"Please enter your new password twice so we can verify you typed it in "
"correctly."
msgstr "Escribe tu nueva contraseña dos veces para comprobar que es correcta."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/confirm.html:20
msgid "Change my password"
msgstr "Cambiar mi contraseña"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/confirm.html:24
msgid "Invalid Link"
msgstr "Enlace no válido"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/confirm.html:25
msgid ""
"The password reset link was invalid, possibly because it has already been "
"used.  Please request a new password reset."
msgstr ""
"El enlace para restablecer la contraseña no es válido, quizá porque ya se "
"usó. Solicita uno nuevo."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/confirm.html:26
msgid "Reenter your email"
msgstr "Vuelve a escribir tu correo"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/done.html:10
msgid "Check your mail"
msgstr "Revisa tu correo"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/done.html:14
msgid ""
"We’ve emailed you instructions for setting your password, if an account "
"exists with the email you entered. You should receive them shortly."
msgstr ""
"Si existe una cuenta con ese correo, te hemos enviado instrucciones para "
"establecer tu contraseña. Deberían llegarte en breve."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/done.html:15
msgid ""
"If you don’t receive an email, please make sure you’ve entered the address "
"you registered with, and check your spam folder."
msgstr ""
"Si no recibes el correo, comprueba que has escrito la dirección con la que "
"te registraste y revisa la carpeta de spam."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/email.html:2
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're receiving this email because you requested a password reset for your "
"user account at %(site_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Recibes este correo porque has solicitado restablecer la contraseña de tu "
"cuenta en %(site_name)s."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/email.html:4
msgid "Please go to the following page and choose a new password:"
msgstr "Ve a la siguiente página y elige una contraseña nueva:"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/email.html:8
msgid "Your username, in case you’ve forgotten:"
msgstr "Tu nombre de usuario, por si lo has olvidado:"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/email.html:10
msgid "Thanks for using our site!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por usar ecobasa!"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/email.html:12
#, python-format
msgid "The %(site_name)s team"
msgstr "El equipo de %(site_name)s"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/form.html:13
msgid "Login"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/form.html:18
msgid "Forgotten your password?"
msgstr "¿Has olvidado tu contraseña?"

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/form.html:22
msgid ""
"Forgotten your password? Enter your email address below, and we’ll email "
"instructions for setting a new one."
msgstr ""
"¿Has olvidado tu contraseña? Escribe tu correo abajo y te enviaremos "
"instrucciones para crear una nueva."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/form.html:27
msgid "Reset my password"
msgstr "Restablecer mi contraseña"

#: users/templates/users/register.html:17
msgid "Back to log in"
msgstr "Volver a iniciar sesión"

#: users/templates/users/register.html:21
msgid "Register for an account at ecobasa"
msgstr "Regístrate en ecobasa"

#: users/templates/users/register.html:30
msgid "Your location"
msgstr "Tu ubicación"

#: users/templates/users/register.html:32
msgid ""
"Enables other ecobasa members to find you with your skills and as a "
"potential member of their community or community-tour."
msgstr ""
"Permite que otros miembros de ecobasa te encuentren por tus habilidades y "
"como posible miembro de su comunidad o Community-Tour."

#: users/templates/users/register.html:40
msgid "Register"
msgstr "Registrarse"

#: users/templates/users/update.html:16
msgid "Back to profile"
msgstr "Volver al perfil"

#: users/templates/users/update.html:27
msgid "Current photo"
msgstr "Foto actual"

#: users/templates/users/update.html:30
msgid "Remove photo"
msgstr "Quitar foto"

#: users/templates/users/update.html:60
msgid ""
"We compare your wishes, offers and skills with those of people, communities "
"and projects within this distance of your place, as soon as something is "
"added. New suggestions show in your notifications; the email collects them "
"once a week."
msgstr ""
"Comparamos tus deseos, ofertas y habilidades con los de personas, "
"comunidades y proyectos dentro de esta distancia de tu lugar, en cuanto se "
"añade algo. Las sugerencias nuevas aparecen en tus notificaciones; el correo "
"las reúne una vez por semana."

#: users/templates/users/update.html:65
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Guardar cambios"

